      "updated": 1785968511839,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1. View Views from publisher around the world\n2. Infinite scroll\n3. Redirect to article on publisher website\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. availability >> consistency\n2. Scale to spike of 500m DAU\n3. Low latency feed load (<200ms)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1. View Views from publisher around the world\n2. Infinite scroll\n3. Redirect to article on publisher website\n\n\nNon-functional requirements\n1. availability >> consistency\n2. Scale to spike of 500m DAU\n3. Low latency feed load (<200ms)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
